## A focus on custom metal gifts

Golden One began operations in 2006 and has continued to develop custom metal gifts for brands, events, awards, clubs, associations, and promotional programs. The range includes lapel pins, challenge coins, medals, keychains, and related presentation pieces.

## From artwork to a defined object

Projects can begin with a logo, sketch, photograph, or reference product. The practical work is to translate that idea into a clear shape, readable relief, suitable color treatment, fittings, and presentation.

## A direct project conversation

Send the intended product, artwork, quantity, delivery country, and target date. The team can then review the idea, identify the decisions still open, and prepare a focused quotation.
